<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 69-0 IN 2ND INNINGS V PAKISTAN - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 69-0 IN 2ND INNINGS V PAKISTAN - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 69</p>
<p>for no wicket in their second innings, still 112 runs behind</p>
<p>Pakistan, at the close on the third day of the second test on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 249 and 69 0. Pakistan 430.</p>
</text>
